1
00:00:00,172 --> 00:00:07,080
Part 20 mein accounts: double-entry books, trial balance, day book, chemist ledger,

2
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:14,904
supplier ledger, receipt aur payment vouchers, expenses, aur bank statement se reconciliation.

3
00:00:15,856 --> 00:00:19,299
Finance mein Accounts and bank kholiye.

4
00:00:19,299 --> 00:00:26,627
Medoro mein alag se entry nahi karni padti: har invoice, credit note, receipt, GRN,

5
00:00:26,627 --> 00:00:31,748
payment aur claim apne-aap ek balanced voucher banata hai.

6
00:00:31,748 --> 00:00:34,308
Voucher kabhi edit nahi hote.

7
00:00:34,983 --> 00:00:41,222
Trial balance mein har account ka debit aur credit hai: bank, cash in hand,

8
00:00:41,222 --> 00:00:47,128
cheques in hand, input aur output GST, purchases, sales, sales returns,

9
00:00:47,128 --> 00:00:54,115
sundry debtors yaani chemists se lena, aur sundry creditors yaani suppliers ko dena.

10
00:00:54,115 --> 00:00:56,195
Neeche total barabar hai.

11
00:00:56,876 --> 00:01:03,222
Expenses bhi isi mein dikhte hain: rent, salaries, bijli aur delivery ka kharcha.

12
00:01:03,222 --> 00:01:06,042
Is demo mein yeh pehle se darj hain.

13
00:01:06,042 --> 00:01:11,526
Distribution ki screens mein abhi expense jodne ka alag form nahi hai,

14
00:01:11,526 --> 00:01:13,720
yeh QA report mein darj hai.

15
00:01:14,415 --> 00:01:22,438
Day book tab mein din ya mahine ke saare vouchers kram se: voucher number, type, narration,

16
00:01:22,438 --> 00:01:23,937
debit aur credit.

17
00:01:23,937 --> 00:01:28,786
Sales voucher, receipt, payment, journal, sab ek jagah.

18
00:01:28,786 --> 00:01:33,899
Isse cash book aur bank book ki jagah bhi kaam chalta hai.

19
00:01:34,626 --> 00:01:37,867
Chemist ka ledger uski profile mein hai.

20
00:01:37,867 --> 00:01:43,214
Jaise Doranda Drug House: opening balance, har invoice debit mein,

21
00:01:43,214 --> 00:01:48,157
har receipt aur credit note credit mein, aur running balance.

22
00:01:48,157 --> 00:01:52,046
Date range daal kar statement nikaal sakte hain.

23
00:01:52,721 --> 00:01:59,268
Supplier ka ledger supplier page par hai, jo Part 7 mein dekha: GRN credit mein,

24
00:01:59,268 --> 00:02:02,787
payments debit mein, aur We owe ka balance.

25
00:02:02,787 --> 00:02:07,861
Trial balance ka sundry creditors in sab suppliers ka jod hai.

26
00:02:08,604 --> 00:02:14,542
Bank reconciliation tab mein bank ka statement CSV ya Excel mein import kariye.

27
00:02:14,542 --> 00:02:20,630
Medoro har line ko books ki entry se milata hai: rakam, tareekh aur reference se.

28
00:02:20,630 --> 00:02:27,320
Jo nahi mila, woh Unmatched lines mein dikhta hai, aur use haath se match kar sakte hain.

29
00:02:28,022 --> 00:02:33,151
Automatic bank feed ya Account Aggregator abhi connected nahi hai.

30
00:02:33,151 --> 00:02:36,026
Statement file import hi tareeka hai.

31
00:02:36,026 --> 00:02:42,942
Profit and loss statement Distribution ki screen par abhi alag se nahi hai; trial balance

32
00:02:42,942 --> 00:02:48,226
ke sales, purchases aur kharche ke aankde CA ko diye jaa sakte hain.

33
00:02:48,902 --> 00:02:55,848
Accounts ka sabse bada faayda: bikri, kharid aur paisa, teeno ek hi system mein,

34
00:02:55,848 --> 00:02:58,713
isliye hisaab apne-aap milta hai.

35
00:02:58,713 --> 00:03:02,794
Mahine ke ant mein trial balance CA ko bhejiye.
